OL,3,GNEWSAWhose photos were left in this '53
OL,4,ABeetle glovebox?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired bus mechanic is trying to
OL,7,Ffind the original owners of a 1953
OL,8,FVolkswagen Beetle so he can reunite
OL,9,Fthem with a collection of photographs
OL,10,Ffound in the glovebox.
OL,12,FDave Pragnell became besotted with the
OL,13,F"very, very rare" split-back window
OL,14,FBeetle he spotted in Loughton, Essex,
OL,15,Fin 1975, and bought from a student.
OL,17,FDespite its busted engine, the
OL,18,F75-year-old towed the yellow car back
OL,19,Fto Waltham Abbey where he discovered
OL,20,F"crumpled negatives of colour film" in
OL,21,Fthe glovebox.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
