OL,3,GNEWSAWhose photos were left in this '53
OL,4,ABeetle glovebox?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe enduring mystery has now been taken
OL,7,Fup by Julian Robinson, the owner of a
OL,8,Frestoration yard in Arlesley,
OL,9,FBedfordshire, who has become fascinated
OL,10,Fby the pictures.
